41372::$$$message_0286_0000_0000$$$::"I can't believe it's 'unlucky'... I give up."::
41373::$$$message_0286_0001_0000$$$::"Apparently if you print out the screen within ten seconds, tie it to a tree, and redraw a fortune, it will be nullified. But that's also pretty sorry.[cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01d(中)] Actually, it's impossible."::
41374::$$$message_0286_0002_0000$$$::"Well, shake on it around here.[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01b(中)]Yeah, you should think of it this way.[br]::
